- chooser closes immediately;
- 2 turns to complete;
- movement or damage interrupts;
- scroll/oil are consumed only on success;
- equipped weapons are valid targets.

Today’s focused tests passed: 17/17, plus `deno check` and `deno task check`. I found no separate “test auto-fix” run; the change is recorded in today’s `feat: enchanting takes a moment` commit.

